3	action	end
2	line	Dark Mage	Oh, hang on. Someone is trying to contact me...
2	box	The Dark Mage suddenly starts talking to someone else.
2	line	Dark Mage	What do you want? Can't you see I'm busy?
2	line	Dark Mage	Fine. A simple transfiguration spell should resolve things for you.
2	line	Dark Mage	Now can you leave me alone? I can't keep affording these distractions!
2	box	The Dark Mage turns back to you.
2	line	Dark Mage	What did you want? Something about an amulet?
2	line	Player	Yes, but first...
2	box	You throw the bucket of water over the Dark Mage.
2	line	Dark Mage	What in the actual...
2	line	Player	Sorry, but Herbert said you needed a wash.
2	line	Dark Mage	Are you serious? What if I'd lost concentration and let this rift collapse? Do you like having a brain that isn't made of mush? Because mush is all that would have been left!
2	line	Player	I like my brain how it is, thanks. Now, could you help me?
2	line	Dark Mage	Why should I? I'm soaked thanks to you!
2	line	Player	Herbert said you would.
2	line	Dark Mage	Of course he did! Alright then, what do you want?
2	line	Player	This amulet is giving off abyssal energy. I need you to cast a spell to tell me where it came from.
2	line	Dark Mage	Let's have a look then.
2	box	You show the amulet to the Dark Mage.
2	line	Dark Mage	Right, just give me a moment.
2	box	The Dark Mage casts a spell on the amulet.
2	line	Dark Mage	Okay, this spell will allow me to triangulate the origin of the amulet. To make things easier, I'm using this rift to compare energy from that origin with energy from the runic altars.
2	line	Dark Mage	Of course, thanks to the ways time and space work in this place, the information won't necessarily come in the right order.
2	line	Player	Meaning?
2	line	Dark Mage	Meaning I'll need you to help, you fool! You see that energy that's just emerged from the rift? Work out which order it goes in!
2	line	Player	Right...
2	action	end
1	option	I need your help with something.
1	option	Sorry, I'll go.
