1	option	Sorry, I'll go.
0	section	Obtaining the incantation
1	line	Player	I've worked out which order the energy goes in.
1	line	Dark Mage	Yes, I can see that. Now, hang on.
1	box	The Dark Mage pauses for a moment, as if lost in thought. He then hastily pulls out a scroll and scribbles something on it.
1	line	Dark Mage	I've noted the details on this scroll. A competent enough wizard should be able to use it to cast a teleportation spell to take you right there.
1	line	Player	Can you tell me anything about the place?
1	line	Dark Mage	With all the time I've spent here, I'd like to consider myself an expert on the Abyss, but there's something very strange about the place this amulet came from.
1	line	Player	Strange how?
1	line	Dark Mage	Well if I knew that, it wouldn't be strange, would it? Now, if you're done bothering me, I need to stay focused on this rift!
1	box	The Dark Mage hands you an incantation.
1	action	end
