1	option	Could you help me with that amulet now?
2	line	Player	Could you help me with that amulet now?
2	line	Mage of Zamorak	The spell to determine the origin of that amulet will only work from the Abyss, so you'll need to have the initiate there perform it for you.
2	line	Player	Oh, he already did that.
2	line	Mage of Zamorak	Then why are you talking to me? You have what you need.
