0	section	Talking to Archmage Sedridor
1	line	Player	Hello there.
1	line	Archmage Sedridor	Hello again, {player}. What can I do for you?
1	option	Can you teleport me to the Rune Essence Mine?
1	option	I need your help with an incantation.
2	line	Player	I need your help with an incantation.
2	line	Archmage Sedridor	An incantation, hmm? What incantation?
2	line	Player	A teleport that could potentially take us to an ancient teleportation matrix. Persten reckons you might be able to use it to gain easier access to the runic altars.
2	line	Archmage Sedridor	Wait... Persten sent you?
2	line	Player	That's right. Oh, I should also mention that this teleportation matrix seems to have some connection to your order, despite predating it by thousands of years.
2	line	Archmage Sedridor	So Persten disappears for all this time, and then shows up again with knowledge on an ancient teleportation matrix? I suppose I shouldn't be surprised. It's probably not the strangest thing she's done.
2	line	Archmage Sedridor	Anyway, what do you need my help with exactly?
2	line	Player	Persten needs three other wizards to be able to perform the incantation.
2	line	Archmage Sedridor	Hmm... can I see it?
2	cond	If the player doesn't have the incantation:
3	line	Player	Oh, I don't have it with me.
3	line	Archmage Sedridor	I'd very much like to see it. Come back to me when you have it.
3	action	end
2	line	Player	Sure.
2	box	You give the incantation to Sedridor.
2	line	Archmage Sedridor	Hmm... this scroll is very interesting. Did you get it from a Zamorakian wizard, perhaps? Don't lie to me, {player}.
2	line	Player	Well since you asked... I... well...
2	line	Archmage Sedridor	It's clear from your response that my suspicions are correct. This incantation is written on very thin flesh rather than parchment, a horrific practice only used by Zamorakians.
2	line	Archmage Sedridor	Need I remind you that it was the Zamorakians who burnt down the first Wizards' Tower?
2	line	Player	Er...
2	line	Archmage Sedridor	{player}, I'm going to be frank with you. Persten hasn't been seen here for almost a year. My last meeting with her was to discuss changing her line of study due to her lack of results.
2	line	Archmage Sedridor	She was given one more year to produce something of note. Now, with time almost up, she sends you here with Zamorakian incantations and odd claims about an ancient teleportation matrix.
2	line	Player	But what if it's true? That teleportation matrix could change everything!
2	line	Player	Okay, I admit we went to some Zamorakians for help with the incantation, but they've had no other involvement. Persten has even made sure they won't get anything beneficial out of this.
2	line	Archmage Sedridor	Hmm... You have been a great help to us in the past. For that, I will consider it. First though, I will do a thorough arcane analysis of this incantation to determine if it is safe to cast.
2	line	Archmage Sedridor	Now, as for your three wizards, I can't be wasting the others' time with this sort of thing, especially when I haven't even agreed to allow it yet.
2	line	Archmage Sedridor	However, Traiborn has three new apprentices who could help. This might be a good learning opportunity for them. Speak to him while I inspect this incantation.
2	option	Can you teleport me to the Rune Essence Mine?
2	option	Who else knows the teleport to the Rune Essence Mine?
2	option	Could you tell me about the old Wizards' Tower?
2	option	Okay, thanks.
3	line	Player	Okay, thanks.
3	action	end
1	option	Who else knows the teleport to the Rune Essence Mine?
1	option	Could you tell me about the old Wizards' Tower?
1	option	Nothing thanks, I'm just looking around.
