0	section	Talking to Wizard Traiborn
1	line	Wizard Traiborn	Ello young thingummywut.
1	option	What's a thingummywut?
1	option	I need your apprentices to help with an incantation.
2	line	Player	I need your apprentices to help with an incantation.
2	line	Wizard Traiborn	Right now? But we're having a party!
2	line	Player	A party?
2	line	Wizard Traiborn	Party? What party?
2	line	Player	You said you were having a party?
2	line	Wizard Traiborn	Well I suppose it is a party of sorts. A study party! Would you like to join in? You look like you could use one!
2	line	Player	I'll pass... Anyway, Sedridor said your apprentices could help me with an incantation.
2	line	Wizard Traiborn	What kind of incantation?
2	line	Player	One that could lead us to an ancient teleportation matrix.
2	line	Wizard Traiborn	Teleportation matrix? Doesn't sound like the most comfortable place for a party... I bet it's full of thingummywuts as well!
2	line	Player	I'm not suggesting we move the party there. I'm suggesting that we cancel the party and discover the secrets of this teleportation matrix instead.
2	line	Wizard Traiborn	Cancel the party? You're certainly a party pooper!
2	line	Player	Alright, how about instead of cancelling the party, we finish it with a bang? What's currently on the agenda?
2	line	Wizard Traiborn	Finish it with a bang? Sedridor won't be happy if we burn the place down again, will he? Still, I like it!
2	line	Wizard Traiborn	I've currently tasked each of the apprentices with solving a problem. If they all solve it, we can celebrate together!
2	line	Player	Sounds good. So, what's the problem?
2	line	Wizard Traiborn	Problem? There's no problem! Everything is fine here. We're having a party!
2	line	Player	I mean what's the problem they have to solve?
2	line	Wizard Traiborn	Oh! It's trivial! They just have to figure out what a thingummywut is!
2	line	Player	A thingummy... what?
2	line	Wizard Traiborn	Precisely!
2	line	Player	Right... I'll speak to the apprentices. Perhaps together we can figure this out.
2	line	Wizard Traiborn	Good luck!
2	action	end
1	option	Teach me to be a mighty and powerful wizard.
1	option	I'd better go.
