0	section	Cordelia
1	line	Apprentice Cordelia	Thingummywut. Thin... gummy... what?
1	line	Player	Traiborn said you're trying to solve a puzzle? Maybe I could help?
1	line	Apprentice Cordelia	Why? Do you think I need your help to solve this? I'll prove I'm smarter than these two!
1	line	Player	Oh, I don't doubt you're smart enough to solve this on your own. I'd just like to see the puzzle to further my own knowledge and understanding.
1	line	Apprentice Cordelia	You think I'll be persuaded that easily? I'm not as easy to fool as the others, but I admire your efforts nonetheless.
1	line	Player	I'll be honest then. In truth, I don't care about this puzzle at all. I'm actually looking to recruit some talented wizards to help uncover a long-lost teleportation matrix.
1	line	Player	The hope is to use it to gain easy access to the runic altars for runecrafting purposes.
1	line	Apprentice Cordelia	Well that's infinitely more interesting! In that case, why do you care about the puzzle?
1	line	Player	Traiborn said that he wouldn't give his permission for you to join me until the puzzle is solved, so I thought I'd lend a hand.
1	line	Apprentice Cordelia	Very well, you appear to be telling the truth, and I'd rather be uncovering a teleportation matrix than doing this.
1	line	Apprentice Cordelia	Here it is.
