0	section	Felix
1	line	Apprentice Felix	So, if that's six and this is eight, then if we multiply... No, divide? No, that's not it either.
1	line	Player	Sounds like you're trying to solve a puzzle. Perhaps I could help?
1	line	Apprentice Felix	Oh, hey there! Yes, I'm trying to solve a puzzle set by the world-renowned Traiborn himself! It truly is an honour to have someone like him take the time to teach an up-and-coming wizard such as myself.
1	line	Player	Why do you think so highly of him?
1	line	Apprentice Felix	Oh, so many reasons! But the biggest is that amongst all of the wizards, he is the foremost expert in extra- planar magic!
1	line	Apprentice Felix	Why else do you think he has the smallest room in the tower? Because he doesn't need the space! He can just open a portal to create more!
1	line	Player	I see, and is this the branch of magic you want to specialise in?
1	line	Apprentice Felix	Oh absolutely! That's why I'm here. I need to solve this puzzle to prove that I'm ready to learn all that he has to teach.
1	line	Player	Well that's actually not too different to the reason I'm here. I'm currently helping a wizard called Persten, and she seems to be quite knowledgeable on different planes.
1	line	Player	She's tasked me with recruiting some wizards to help her uncover a teleportation matrix. Would you like to join us?
1	line	Apprentice Felix	You've met Persten? She studied directly under Traiborn for multiple years! I'd love to meet her, but she's hard to track down. Could you introduce us?
1	line	Player	Sure, I can do that. We need to solve this puzzle first though. Traiborn won't let you three leave until you do. Perhaps I could help you solve it?
1	line	Apprentice Felix	I'm not sure. I wouldn't want Traiborn to think poorly of me if I've cheated and asked for help... but I do want to work with Persten...
1	line	Apprentice Felix	Okay, I'll show you the puzzle.
