1	line	Apprentice Cordelia	You can't be serious!
1	line	Apprentice Tamara	Please let us help! We've all worked so hard for an opportunity like this!
1	line	Apprentice Felix	And we have Persten to look after us!
1	line	Archmage Sedridor	No. You are only apprentices. You were here to help with the incantation, and you've done that now. You should go back to your studies.
1	line	Wizard Traiborn	Come now, Sedridor. The young thingummywuts have proven themselves to be more than capable. Let them have their party!
1	line	Wizard Persten	It's going to be quite something! You really should let them help!
1	line	Archmage Sedridor	Quiet, Persten!
1	line	Archmage Sedridor	Let it be known that I consider this a bad idea. That said, they are your apprentices, Traiborn. If they have your permission, I won't stop them.
