1	line	Player	Hey!
1	line	Wizard Persten	...
1	line	Player	Hello?
1	line	Wizard Persten	Oh, sorry, I didn't see you there. I was lost in thought!
1	line	Player	What were you thinking about?
1	line	Wizard Persten	Hmm? Oh, I was looking at these markings here. They're very interesting! They seem to be radiating a magical energy I've never encountered before!
1	line	Wizard Persten	Take a closer look! Maybe you'll feel the energy as well!
1	box	You look at the markings...
1	line	First Mysterious Voice	Saradomin be with you.
1	line	Second Mysterious Voice	And with you, Zachariah. So, it's really true?
1	line	Zachariah	Indeed it is, Aliya, and he has given us the task of protecting it.
1	line	Aliya	What would he have me do?
1	line	Zachariah	You must build a sanctuary for the Eye. The forces of chaos already seek to reobtain it, as do countless others.
1	line	Aliya	I will keep it safe, no matter the cost. And you?
1	line	Zachariah	Zamorak has tasked his collector with finding the Eye. I will hunt him down before he does, along with any others who would try to claim it.
1	line	Aliya	Then I wish you luck, brother.
1	line	Zachariah	There is one last thing, Aliya. You must keep the Eye secret from all others, even our own. The fewer people that know the truth, the better.
1	line	Aliya	On my honour as a justiciar, it will be done.
1	line	Zachariah	Good. Saradomin be with you, sister.
1	line	Player	What the...
1	line	Wizard Persten	{player}?
1	line	Player	Jas!
1	line	Wizard Persten	What did you say?
1	line	Player	I... I don't know.
1	line	Wizard Persten	Did you just say... 'Jas'?
1	line	Player	I can't remember. When I looked at the marks on the floor I had this... vision, but it's all unclear.
1	line	Wizard Persten	Curious...
1	line	Wizard Persten	Well, time to see what the others have found!
1	action	Abyssal rift cutscene continues below.
0	section	Talking to Wizard Persten after starting the Abyssal rift cutscene
1	line	Wizard Persten	Hey! Let's see what the others have found!
1	action	Abyssal rift cutscene continues below.
0	section	Abyssal rift cutscene
1	line	Wizard Persten	Right, what have we discovered?
1	line	Apprentice Cordelia	That large hole behind you is radiating a strange energy. I'm still trying to work out what it is.
1	line	Wizard Persten	Need a hand with that?
1	line	Apprentice Cordelia	No, I can work it out.
1	line	Wizard Persten	You sure can! What else do we have?
1	line	Apprentice Tamara	There's some old rune guardians here with eye symbols on them.
1	line	Wizard Persten	So this place was definitely used by wizards at one point. Amazing!
1	line	Apprentice Felix	Not just any wizards, Saradominist wizards! There's some statues of an old Saradominist Justiciar called Aliya!
1	line	Wizard Persten	Remarkable! The justiciars haven't been around for thousands of years. That confirms my suspicions about the age of this place.
1	line	Apprentice Felix	That's not all I found. Apparently, this place was once called the Temple of the Eye!
1	line	Apprentice Cordelia	The Eye? What's the Eye?
1	line	Apprentice Tamara	I remember reading about something called the Eye back at the Wizards' Tower! I only came across mention of it once, but apparently it was a powerful artefact made by Saradomin himself!
1	line	Wizard Persten	Sorry... made by Saradomin, you say?
1	line	Apprentice Tamara	That's what the book said. Why?
1	line	Wizard Persten	Oh, just checking! I get all caught up in the moment and mishear things sometimes.
1	line	Player	This 'Eye'... did the book say what it looked like?
1	line	Apprentice Tamara	It didn't. It didn't actually have any other information on it. I tried to learn more from other books, but found nothing.
1	line	Apprentice Felix	Anything else was probably lost when the first Wizards' Tower burnt down.
1	line	Apprentice Cordelia	Of course! I've worked out what the energy from that hole is. It's abyssal energy!
1	line	Wizard Persten	Hmm... Yes... Brilliant!
1	line	Player	Persten?
1	line	Wizard Persten	Ah, sorry! Lost in thought again! It was for a good reason though. I think I've just about worked it all out!
1	line	Apprentice Felix	Amazing as always, Persten! We're so lucky to be able to work with you.
1	line	Wizard Persten	Thank you! So, I reckon my theory that this is an old teleportation matrix was spot on! The wizards here must have used power from the Abyss to create portals to the runic altars.
1	line	Wizard Persten	Then, with the power from this 'Eye' and support from their rune guardians, they'd have been able to create runes at lightning speed!
1	line	Wizard Persten	The Eye must have had a huge impact on their work. They named the temple after it and fashioned a symbol based on it.
1	line	Apprentice Tamara	And we're still using that symbol today! We just never knew why until now!
1	line	Apprentice Felix	Should we report back to Sedridor?
1	line	Wizard Persten	In a moment. I'm just going to cast a simple revealing spell first, just in case there's anything else hidden here.
1	line	Apprentice Tamara	What's happening?
1	line	Wizard Persten	Don't worry! I'm sure everything is fine. Let me handle this.
1	line	Wizard Persten	Huh... now that is a problem.
1	line	Apprentice Felix	Persten!
1	line	Apprentice Cordelia	You don't belong in this temple, accursed filth!
1	line	The Great Guardian	And so the rift to the Scar is open once more. Humans, fight with us. Let us hold back the Abyss!
1	action	Great Guardian cutscene continues below.
