0	section	Talking to Tamara after powering the Great Guardian
1	box	You show the cell and the talisman to Tamara.
1	line	Player	Something odd happened at the Water Altar. The energy in this cell seems different to before. The essence also formed this strange talisman.
1	line	Apprentice Tamara	Oh, fascinating! I guess it makes sense that the stronger the runic energy, the more powerful the cell will be. After all, water is more powerful than air or mind.
1	line	Apprentice Tamara	Try making another rune guardian using that cell. In the meantime, I'll see if I can work out what this talisman does.
1	action	end
0	section	Talking to Tamara again
1	line	Apprentice Tamara	Try making another rune guardian using that new cell. In the meantime, I'll see if I can work out what this talisman does.
1	line	Player	Alright.
1	action	end
0	section	Talking to Felix before making another guardian
1	line	Player	I need to make another rune guardian.
1	line	Apprentice Felix	Go right ahead. Just use a chisel to shape one of these essence piles and then infuse the result with a cell.
1	action	end
0	section	Constructing the medium elemental guardian
1	line	Apprentice Felix	Look at that! I don't know what you did, but that guardian is much stronger than the ones you made before.
1	action	end
0	section	Talking to Tamara after constructing the medium elemental guardian
1	line	Player	That cell made a more powerful rune guardian!
1	line	Apprentice Tamara	Great! We're almost there! I think we just need to power up this guardian one more time for it to be able to close that rift.
1	line	The Great Guardian	I must conserve my power. The portal to the Runic Altar of Water has closed.
1	line	Player	But we need that portal!
1	line	Apprentice Tamara	Don't worry, I think there's another way. I reckon that talisman you gave me can be used to return to the Water Altar without the portal being open.
1	box	Tamara hands you the talisman.
1	line	Apprentice Tamara	Just present that talisman to the statue where the portal to the Water Altar was. Make sure you take more essence and another cell with you.
1	action	end
0	section	Talking to Tamara again
